# Everything under data/ is local assets — models, videos, extracted packages —
# and must never be committed. The shared deployment layer is the exception:
# these files are how every machine gets set up the same way, so they are
# tracked.
#
# Negation only works while the parent directory itself is not excluded, which
# is why these are listed individually rather than via a directory rule.
*
!.gitignore
!DEPLOY.md
!datasets.yml
!common.sh
!setup-data.sh
!launch-deployment.sh
!build-fusion.sh
